<title>USA: Smith Barney adds Planet Hollywood to list.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney adds Planet Hollywood to list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has added Planet Hollywood International Inc to its emerging growth stock focus list, a source at the brokerage said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the restaurant franchiser continued to be rated buy, high risk.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were up 3/8 to 14 in early trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
